clean_summary:
I honestly have no words for calling it 'megakernel' when in fact it’s just a bag of kernels.

@aybek9221 reports that Laguna XS + GRPO training on a single RTX 4090 achieves approximately 180 tokens per second at batch 1 and about 499 tokens per second at batch 8. The implementation uses in-place, memory-efficient forward and backward passes with custom kernels.

The linked GitHub repository is KONAKONA666/fastgrpo, which is for contributing to the development of fastGRPO.
